  "details": "The corosync packages provide the Corosync Cluster Engine and C APIs for AlmaLinux cluster software.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * corosync: corosync: heap-based buffer overflow in totempg assembly buffer during fragmented message reassembly (CVE-2026-81665)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
